---
layout: default
body_classes:
  - doc-page
---
{%- comment -%}
  A page below the top level: it opens on the trail that leads to it.
{%- endcomment -%}
<main class='flex-shrink-0'>
  <article>
    <header class='doc-head'>
      <div class='wrap'>
        {% include 'breadcrumb.liquid' %}
        <h1 class='doc-title'>{{ title }}</h1>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class='doc-body'>
      <div class='wrap'>
        <div class='doc-prose'>{{ content }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</main>
